LAMMPS (19 Nov 2024 - Development - patch_19Nov2024-56-ga78aee5731)
#------------------------Aluminum Simulation------------------#

# Initial setup
units           metal
dimension       3
processors      * * *
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p

#-------------------------Lattice Setup-----------------------#

# Define the aluminum lattice structure and create the simulation box

#lattice         fcc 4.05             # FCC lattice for aluminum with lattice constant 4.05 Å
#region          box block 0 5 0 5 0 5 units lattice
#create_box      1 box
#create_atoms    1 box

read_data       ../../structures/Al.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (4.03893 4.03893 4.03893)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  4 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.003 seconds
replicate       5 5 5
Replication is creating a 5x5x5 = 125 times larger system...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20.19465 20.19465 20.19465)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  500 atoms
  replicate CPU = 0.000 seconds

#-------------------------Potential---------------------------#

# Define the potential for aluminum

pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../../../../modal_app/potentials/EAM/Al99.eam.alloy Al

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

#-----------------------Minimization--------------------------#

# Perform energy minimization
thermo          50
thermo_style    custom step atoms temp pe ke etotal press
min_style       sd
minimize        1.0e-10 1.0e-10 100000 100000
